26
00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:46.640
Why He Really Did It. The Vietnam War was bleeding money faster than Congress could appropriate it.

27
00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:51.440
France wanted their gold back, which was inconvenient because America had been spending it.

28
00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:59.760
Raising taxes would cause riots. The solution was elegant in the way that arson is elegant: just print money forever.

29
00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:03.980
Nobody will notice. (Everyone noticed.). What Actually Happened.

30
00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:12.820
The gold standard died. Dollar backing became "trust us bro," which is not a monetary policy taught in any economics textbook

31
00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:16.300
but is the one your country has been running for fifty-four years.

32
00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:23.540
Inflation went to the moon. Your savings were slowly murdered in their sleep, one percentage point at a time, while the

33
00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:28.840
killer wore a suit and called it "monetary policy.". The Theft That Followed.

34
00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:36.960
Since nineteen seventy-two, productivity went up two hundred and forty-six percent and wages went up one hundred and fifteen

35
00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:44.760
