37
00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:58.800
for playing, please collect your participation trophy on the way out, it's worth less than it was when you walked in).

38
00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:07.520
The Cantillon Effect: Why You're Poor and Raytheon Isn't. The Cantillon Effect, understood since the seventeen hundreds:

39
00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.500
whoever gets newly printed money first gets rich. Whoever gets it last gets robbed.

40
00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:18.800
The Fed prints money. Banks and defense contractors get it first and buy things at today's prices.

41
00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:22.900
By the time it trickles down to your grocery store, prices have already risen.

42
00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.640
You don't notice you've been robbed because nobody broke into your house.

43
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.650
They just made everything in it worth less. Then you blame immigrants as programmed.

44
00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:37.800
Why "Just Fund Medical Research More" Is a Lie. "Why not just ask for donations?

45
00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:42.290
Why not just increase the N.I.H. budget? Why tie it to military spending?".

46
00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:50.200
Because money is not real. It's a shared hallucination. Eight billion people pretending that the same piece of paper is

47
00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.840
