48
00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:00.580
Money is a story you tell each other. The Fixed Pie of Human Genius.

49
00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:08.900
Earth has eight billion brains (fixed quantity), twenty-four hours per day per brain (physics won't negotiate), limited

50
00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:14.260
