51
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.320
When a brilliant engineer designs missiles, that engineer is NOT designing medical devices.

52
00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:24.500
When a factory builds tanks, it is NOT building M.R.I. machines.

53
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:31.100
When a P.h.D. researches better ways to kill people, they are NOT researching better ways to keep people alive.

54
00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:39.210
Every genius has exactly one brain. You are renting forty million of them to build things that explode.

55
00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:46.600
This is, by a comfortable margin, the stupidest resource allocation decision in the observable universe.

56
00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:53.700
The Resource Reality. The top ten percent of human talent is roughly eight hundred million people.

57
00:05:54.660 --> 00:06:02.280
Of those, approximately forty million (including active military, reserves, and defense contractors) are employed building

58
00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:07.240
